      "Deliver monthly financial reporting, analytics, and performance insights.",
      "Conduct departmental and programmatic financial reviews and support forecasting.",
      "Analyze financial and operational results, including performance variances and underlying causes.",
      "Assist with budgeting, forecasts, and scenario planning.",
      "Perform budget-to-actual variance analysis and identify adjustments, trends, shortfalls, overruns, and cost-saving opportunities.",
      "Prepare weekly cash-flow reports and projections.",
      "Prepare monthly, quarterly, annual, and ad hoc financial statements.",
      "Review transaction systems, processes, and internal controls and recommend improvements.",
      "Perform variance analyses and account reconciliations.",
      "Support month-end and year-end closing, external audits, and audit schedule preparation.",
      "Support transactional processing, financial analysis, cost allocation, compliance controls, and financial oversight.",
      "Work with the Finance & Accounting team on process improvement opportunities."
